ABASE AUTH · STRIPE BILLING ·\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--teal-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"operational status value\">\n                        STATUS: OPERATIONAL\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n            </footer>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n</script>\n",
